This repository holds the Libre AI website. It currently contains no
application and no product code: its tracked files are editorial documentation
and repository workflows.

The licence for each file is declared through REUSE.toml:

- CC-BY-4.0: the READMEs — editorial documentation and first-party project
  records;
- EUPL-1.2: the workflows under `.github/` and the repository configuration,
  first-party software by default.

Full licence texts are stored in LICENSES/.

The organization-wide licensing policy — scope, precedence, historical grants,
data and contribution rules — is the canonical one and is not restated here:
https://github.com/libre-ai/libre-ai/blob/main/LICENSING.md

This repository carried no LICENSE file before 2026-07-25, so no MIT or
Apache-2.0 grant was ever made here and none is withdrawn. The revisions
published under the EUPL-1.2 declaration that preceded this per-path one
remain available under those terms.
